T(82,'**Terminology.** We report **numerical verification** of consistency between the implementation, computed solutions and prescribed equations, including analytical benchmarks, grid sensitivity and periodic consistency. Each check has its own coverage and limits. An independent-solver comparison would be a numerical cross-check and would not alone establish physical validation; no such same-geometry comparison has been completed. **Physical validation is outside this study:** the model has not been compared with experimental measurements of the target system. Unless explicitly qualified as physical validation, verification here concerns numerical checks. Conclusions describe discrepancies within this numerical model, rather than its fidelity to real imprint processes.')
